#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find cut locations, given a maximum of 4 qubits per subcircuit. This circuit can be separated in two by making a single wire cut and cutting one `CRZGate` {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-cutting-one-crzgate}"
msgstr "Cari lokasi potongan, dengan had maksimum 4 qubit setiap subCircuit. Circuit ini boleh dipisahkan kepada dua dengan membuat satu potongan wayar dan memotong satu `CRZGate` {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-cutting-one-crzgate}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/04-automatic-cut-finding/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Gambar rajah Circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/04-automatic-cut-finding/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add ancillas for wire cuts and expand the observables to account for ancilla qubits {#add-ancillas-for-wire-cuts-and-expand-the-observables-to-account-for-ancilla-qubits}"
msgstr "Tambah ancilla untuk potongan wayar dan kembangkan observable bagi mengambil kira qubit ancilla {#add-ancillas-for-wire-cuts-and-expand-the-observables-to-account-for-ancilla-qubits}"

#. type: Plain text
